{"info":{"title":"Chain Chronicle: Haecceitas no Hikari Part 2","originalTitle":"Chain Chronicle: The Light of Haecceitas Part 2","synopsis":"Questa è la storia di Chain Chronicle, un libro che descrive tutto ciò che accade nel mondo. I cittadini del remoto continente di Yggd un tempo pensavano che non esistessero altre terre. Il continente era diviso in diverse regioni, ognuna con il suo re. Nonostante qualche scaramuccia, un signore, scelto da tutti i re, ha sempre mantenuto l'equilibrio -- finché non è giunto l'Esercito Nero. L'Esercito Volontario, comandato da Yuri, non può nulla contro l'Esercito Nero. Durante lo scontro, il Signore dei Neri ruba una metà di Chain Chronicle, oltre a conquistare la capitale. Durante la ritirata, Yuri e l'Esercito Volontario incontrano un ragazzo che combatte l'Esercito Nero da solo. Così inizia la storia di Chain Chronicle, dell'Esercito Volontario e dell'Esercito Nero che si scontrano per il destino del mondo, e dell'amicizia.","type":"movie","status":"completed","statusLabel":"Finito","audio":"Giapponese","dubbed":false,"releaseDateLabel":"14 Gennaio 2017","year":2017,"season":"Inverno 2017","studios":["Graphinica","Telecom Animation Film"],"genres":["Avventura","Azione","Fantasy","Magia","Shounen"],"durationLabel":"1h e 29 min","declaredEpisodeCount":1,"availableEpisodeCount":4,"rating":6.92,"ratingCount":98,"views":8927,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1R4ziby14n5QaSkUUHTIPEGgLz5.jpg","shareImage":{"base":"img","path":"/locandine/83105l.jpg"},"sourceType":"Movie","tags":["Movie","Finito","2017"],"extra":{"ids":{"anilistIds":[20787,87505,87506],"malIds":[25431,33728,33729],"anidbIds":[10747,12291],"imdbMovieIds":[],"imdbShowIds":[],"tmdbMovieIds":[415282,428294],"tmdbShowIds":[],"tvdbMovieIds":[],"tvdbShowIds":[314031]},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-11-02T08:43:20Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:87506","mal:33729"],"targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10747","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"12291","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20787"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"87505"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"87506","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"25431"},{"provider":"mal","id":"33728"},{"provider":"mal","id":"33729","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"tmdb_movie","id":"415282"},{"provider":"tmdb_movie","id":"428294","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"314031","scope":"s0","ranges":{"1":"10"}}]},"metadataTargets":[{"provider":"anilist","id":"87506","raw":"anilist:87506","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"33729","raw":"mal:33729","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"tmdb_movie","id":"428294","raw":"tmdb_movie:428294","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"314031","scope":"s0","raw":"tvdb_show:314031:s0","ranges":{"1":"10"}}],"sourceIds":{"anilist":87506,"mal":33729},"tmdb":{"source":"tmdb-api","id":428294,"type":"movie","sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/428294","fetchedAt":"2026-11-02T19:39:20.856Z","originalLanguage":"ja-JP","title":{"value":"Chain Chronicle: Haecceitas no Hikari Part 2","language":"it-IT"},"originalTitle":"チェインクロニクル〜ヘクセイタスの閃（ひかり）〜 第２章","overview":{"value":"On their way through the Maze Pass to the mines where a great artifact has been discovered, Yuri and Aram get separated from the rest in the blizzard. Aram acquires a cute little mascot, while the black infection starts to ply Yuri's mind with doubts about his mission and purpose. Meanwhile Juliana has finally decided to take on the full position and responsibilities of succeeding her father to become the Holy Queen, and her entreaty to Shuza, leader of the ogres, to join in a new Black King Suppression Army has an unexpected effect. A planned trip to Spirit Island could provide a valuable clue for where to find Pirika, a journey which must be completed even after calamity strikes. As allies start to fall into despair, Aram begins to shine brighter as the young man who could potentially turn this hopeless situation around. Movie 2 (TV episodes 5-8)","language":"en-US"},"releaseDate":"2017-01-14","status":"Released","rating":6.3,"ratingCount":3,"genres":["Animazione","Azione","Avventura","Fantasy"],"countries":["Japan"],"facts":{"Runtime":"89m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":1168909,"name":"Nao Toyama","role":"Mujika","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6WJDd1z946yFfZBgpC7dWi0FyQw.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Chain Chronicle: Haecceitas no Hikari Part 2"},{"language":"en-US","title":"Chain Chronicle: The Light of Haecceitas Movie 2","overview":"On their way through the Maze Pass to the mines where a great artifact has been discovered, Yuri and Aram get separated from the rest in the blizzard. Aram acquires a cute little mascot, while the black infection starts to ply Yuri's mind with doubts about his mission and purpose. Meanwhile Juliana has finally decided to take on the full position and responsibilities of succeeding her father to become the Holy Queen, and her entreaty to Shuza, leader of the ogres, to join in a new Black King Suppression Army has an unexpected effect. A planned trip to Spirit Island could provide a valuable clue for where to find Pirika, a journey which must be completed even after calamity strikes. As allies start to fall into despair, Aram begins to shine brighter as the young man who could potentially turn this hopeless situation around. Movie 2 (TV episodes 5-8)"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1R4ziby14n5QaSkUUHTIPEGgLz5.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1R4ziby14n5QaSkUUHTIPEGgLz5.jpg","language":"ja","width":1518,"height":2150}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r1fYcbhwZKLNBITqIlj66jKPnrQ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/r1fYcbhwZKLNBITqIlj66jKPnrQ.jpg","language":"xx","widt